{"seq":1,"slug":"jtag-swd-debugging","title":"JTAG/SWD 调试原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/debugging-optimization/jtag-swd-debugging","wordCount":1908,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"jtag-swd-调试原理\">JTAG/SWD 调试原理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>嵌入式调试依赖芯片内置的调试硬件与外部调试器协同工作，使开发者能在不干扰（或尽量少干扰）目标运行的前提下观察与控制程序。本文围绕四条主线展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>调试架构</strong>：JTAG 与 SWD 是两种物理接口，CoreSight 定义了 DP/AP 与各调试组件的标准互连</li>\n<li><strong>断点机制</strong>：FPB 硬件断点免改代码，软件断点以 BKPT 指令替换实现，二者互补</li>\n<li><strong>数据观测</strong>：DWT 提供数据观察点与 CYCCNT 周期计数，用于定位变量修改点与精确计时</li>\n<li><strong>跟踪输出</strong>：ITM/SWO 与 ETM 提供从软件仪器化到完整指令流的不同层次跟踪能力</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"调试接口概述\">调试接口概述</h2><p>嵌入式调试依赖处理器内置的调试硬件单元和外部调试器（Debug Probe）之间的通信。ARM Cortex-M 系列支持两种标准调试接口：JTAG（联合测试行动组）和 SWD（串行线调试），它们为开发者提供断点、单步、内存访问和实时跟踪等能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    PC[主机 IDE] --&gt;|USB| PROBE[调试探针&lt;br/&gt;ST-Link/J-Link]&#10;    PROBE --&gt;|JTAG 或 SWD| TARGET[目标 MCU]&#10;    TARGET --&gt; DAP[调试访问端口 DAP]&#10;    DAP --&gt; AHB_AP[AHB-AP&lt;br/&gt;内存访问]&#10;    DAP --&gt; CTRL[DP 控制]&#10;    AHB_AP --&gt; CORE[CPU 内核]&#10;    AHB_AP --&gt; SRAM[SRAM]&#10;    AHB_AP --&gt; PERIPH[外设寄存器]\">graph LR\n    PC[主机 IDE] --&gt;|USB| PROBE[调试探针&lt;br/&gt;ST-Link/J-Link]\n    PROBE --&gt;|JTAG 或 SWD| TARGET[目标 MCU]\n    TARGET --&gt; DAP[调试访问端口 DAP]\n    DAP --&gt; AHB_AP[AHB-AP&lt;br/&gt;内存访问]\n    DAP --&gt; CTRL[DP 控制]\n    AHB_AP --&gt; CORE[CPU 内核]\n    AHB_AP --&gt; SRAM[SRAM]\n    AHB_AP --&gt; PERIPH[外设寄存器]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>JTAG</th>\n<th>SWD</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信号线数</td>\n<td>5（TCK/TMS/TDI/TDO/TRST）</td>\n<td>2（SWCLK/SWDIO）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据方向</td>\n<td>单向（TDI→TDO）</td>\n<td>双向（SWDIO 分时复用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大时钟</td>\n<td>~20 MHz</td>\n<td>~50 MHz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多设备级联</td>\n<td>支持菊花链</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引脚节约</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>好（仅需 2 引脚）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SWO 跟踪</td>\n<td>需额外引脚</td>\n<td>可复用 SWO 引脚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cortex-M 支持</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td>全部（推荐）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"coresight-调试架构\">CoreSight 调试架构</h2><h3 id=\"组件层次\">组件层次</h3><p>ARM CoreSight 是一套标准化的片上调试与跟踪架构，定义了调试组件的发现、配置和互连方式：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    DP[调试端口 DP&lt;br/&gt;SWJ-DP] --&gt; AP1[AHB-AP&lt;br/&gt;内存访问]&#10;    DP --&gt; AP2[APB-AP&lt;br/&gt;调试组件访问]&#10;    AP1 --&gt; CPU_MEM[CPU 地址空间]&#10;    AP2 --&gt; FPB[FPB&lt;br/&gt;Flash 断点单元]&#10;    AP2 --&gt; DWT[DWT&lt;br/&gt;数据观察点与跟踪]&#10;    AP2 --&gt; ITM[ITM&lt;br/&gt;仪器化跟踪宏单元]&#10;    AP2 --&gt; TPIU[TPIU&lt;br/&gt;跟踪端口接口]&#10;    AP2 --&gt; ETM[ETM&lt;br/&gt;嵌入式跟踪宏单元]\">graph TD\n    DP[调试端口 DP&lt;br/&gt;SWJ-DP] --&gt; AP1[AHB-AP&lt;br/&gt;内存访问]\n    DP --&gt; AP2[APB-AP&lt;br/&gt;调试组件访问]\n    AP1 --&gt; CPU_MEM[CPU 地址空间]\n    AP2 --&gt; FPB[FPB&lt;br/&gt;Flash 断点单元]\n    AP2 --&gt; DWT[DWT&lt;br/&gt;数据观察点与跟踪]\n    AP2 --&gt; ITM[ITM&lt;br/&gt;仪器化跟踪宏单元]\n    AP2 --&gt; TPIU[TPIU&lt;br/&gt;跟踪端口接口]\n    AP2 --&gt; ETM[ETM&lt;br/&gt;嵌入式跟踪宏单元]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DP</td>\n<td>Debug Port</td>\n<td>物理接口协议层（SWD/JTAG）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AHB-AP</td>\n<td>AHB Access Port</td>\n<td>通过 AHB 总线访问全部 4GB 地址空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FPB</td>\n<td>Flash Patch and Breakpoint</td>\n<td>硬件断点（6-8 个）和 Flash 补丁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DWT</td>\n<td>Data Watchpoint and Trace</td>\n<td>数据观察点、周期计数器、异常跟踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ITM</td>\n<td>Instrumentation Trace Macrocell</td>\n<td>printf 风格的软件跟踪输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TPIU</td>\n<td>Trace Port Interface Unit</td>\n<td>跟踪数据输出到 SWO/TracePort</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ETM</td>\n<td>Embedded Trace Macrocell</td>\n<td>完整指令流跟踪（高端内核）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"dap-访问流程\">DAP 访问流程</h3><p>通过 SWD 接口读取 MCU 内存的完整协议流程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>IDE 请求</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>USB 传输</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>探针转换为 SWD 帧</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>DP 选择 AP</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>AHB-AP 发起总线事务</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{IDE 请求} \\rightarrow \\text{USB 传输} \\rightarrow \\text{探针转换为 SWD 帧} \\rightarrow \\text{DP 选择 AP} \\rightarrow \\text{AHB-AP 发起总线事务}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IDE </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">请求</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">USB </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">传输</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">探针转换为</span><span class=\"mord\"> SWD </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">帧</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DP </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">选择</span><span class=\"mord\"> AP</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AHB-AP </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">发起总线事务</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>SWD 协议帧结构：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>位数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Start</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>固定为 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>APnDP</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0=DP 访问，1=AP 访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RnW</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0=写，1=读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>A[2:3]</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>寄存器地址</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Parity</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>奇偶校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stop</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>固定为 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Park</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>固定为 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ACK</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>目标响应（OK/WAIT/FAULT）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DATA</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>数据负载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Parity</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>数据校验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"硬件断点\">硬件断点</h2><h3 id=\"fpb-单元\">FPB 单元</h3><p>Flash Patch and Breakpoint 单元提供硬件断点能力，无需修改 Flash 中的代码：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>断点数量</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mtext>（指令断点）</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>（文字断点）（</mtext><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>M</mi><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>M</mi><mn>4</mn><mtext>典型值）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{断点数量} = 6 \\text{（指令断点）} + 2 \\text{（文字断点）}（Cortex-M3/M4 典型值）</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">断点数量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（指令断点）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（文字断点）</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">3/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">典型值）</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>硬件断点的工作原理：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>将目标地址写入 FPB 比较器寄存器</li>\n<li>CPU 取指时 FPB 并行比较 PC 值</li>\n<li>匹配时产生调试事件，CPU 进入调试状态（Halted）</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"软件断点\">软件断点</h3><p>当硬件断点数量不足时，调试器可使用软件断点：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>原指令</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>替换</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>BKPT #imm（</mtext><mi>T</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>断点指令）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{原指令} \\xrightarrow{\\text{替换}} \\text{BKPT \\#imm}（Thumb-2 断点指令）</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">原指令</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">替换</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BKPT #imm</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mb</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">断点指令）</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>软件断点需要修改 Flash/RAM 中的指令，对 Flash 中的代码需配合 FPB 的 Flash 补丁功能重映射到 SRAM。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据观察点\">数据观察点</h2><h3 id=\"dwt-功能\">DWT 功能</h3><p>DWT（Data Watchpoint and Trace）单元提供数据访问监控：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>数量（M4 典型）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据观察点</td>\n<td>监控特定地址的读/写访问</td>\n<td>4 个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PC 采样</td>\n<td>周期性记录 PC 值</td>\n<td>持续</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周期计数器</td>\n<td>精确测量代码执行周期</td>\n<td>1 个（CYCCNT）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常跟踪</td>\n<td>记录异常进出事件</td>\n<td>持续</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPI 计数</td>\n<td>统计各类指令的额外周期</td>\n<td>6 种分类</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"数据观察点配置\">数据观察点配置</h3><p>数据观察点可监控变量的意外修改：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>触发条件</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>地址匹配</mtext><mo>∧</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>读</mtext><mo>∨</mo><mtext>写</mtext><mo>∨</mo><mtext>读写</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{触发条件} = \\text{地址匹配} \\land (\\text{读} \\lor \\text{写} \\lor \\text{读写})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">触发条件</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">地址匹配</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">读</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">写</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">读写</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>地址掩码</mtext><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mtext> 字节对齐（</mtext><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>MASK 字段值）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{地址掩码} = 2^n \\text{ 字节对齐}（n = \\text{MASK 字段值}）</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">地址掩码</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节对齐</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MASK </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字段值</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当全局变量被意外修改时，数据观察点会在修改瞬间暂停 CPU，调用栈显示修改者的完整上下文。</p>\n<h3 id=\"cyccnt-周期计数器\">CYCCNT 周期计数器</h3><p>DWT_CYCCNT 是一个 32 位递增计数器，每个 CPU 周期加 1：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>执行时间</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>CYCCNT_after</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>CYCCNT_before</mtext></mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>CPU</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{执行时间} = \\frac{\\text{CYCCNT\\_after} - \\text{CYCCNT\\_before}}{f_{\\text{CPU}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">执行时间</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2749em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">CPU</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CYCCNT_after</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CYCCNT_before</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>以 168 MHz 为例，CYCCNT 每 ~25.5 秒溢出一次，适用于微秒至秒级的精确计时。</p>\n<h2 id=\"itm-跟踪输出\">ITM 跟踪输出</h2><h3 id=\"非侵入式-printf\">非侵入式 printf</h3><p>ITM（Instrumentation Trace Macrocell）提供类似 printf 的调试输出，但几乎不影响程序执行时序：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>传输路径：ITM 刺激端口</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>TPIU</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>SWO 引脚</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>探针</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>IDE 终端</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{传输路径}：\\text{ITM 刺激端口} \\rightarrow \\text{TPIU} \\rightarrow \\text{SWO 引脚} \\rightarrow \\text{探针} \\rightarrow \\text{IDE 终端}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">传输路径</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">：</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ITM </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">刺激端口</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TPIU</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SWO </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">引脚</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">探针</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IDE </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">终端</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比</th>\n<th>printf（UART）</th>\n<th>ITM SWO</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>~1 ms/字节</td>\n<td>~几 μs（FIFO 缓冲）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时序影响</td>\n<td>严重（阻塞）</td>\n<td>极小（异步输出）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬件需求</td>\n<td>UART 引脚+USB 转串口</td>\n<td>SWO 引脚（已在调试接口中）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带宽</td>\n<td>115200 bps</td>\n<td>数 Mbps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信息类型</td>\n<td>仅文本</td>\n<td>文本+时间戳+异常事件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"刺激端口\">刺激端口</h3><p>ITM 提供 32 个刺激端口（Stimulus Port），每个端口 32 位宽：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>端口 0：通常用于 printf 重定向</li>\n<li>端口 1-30：可用于不同模块/级别的跟踪</li>\n<li>端口 31：保留给 DWT 硬件事件</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实时跟踪\">实时跟踪</h2><h3 id=\"swo-模式\">SWO 模式</h3><p>SWO（Serial Wire Output）通过单根信号线输出跟踪数据，支持两种编码：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>SWO 带宽</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>时钟频率</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>编码效率</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SWO 带宽} = \\text{时钟频率} \\times \\text{编码效率}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SWO </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">带宽</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">时钟频率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">编码效率</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编码</th>\n<th>效率</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Manchester</td>\n<td>50%</td>\n<td>自带时钟同步，容错好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NRZ/UART</td>\n<td>80%</td>\n<td>异步，带宽更高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"etm-指令跟踪\">ETM 指令跟踪</h3><p>高端调试器（如 J-Trace）配合 ETM 可记录完整的指令执行流：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>跟踪类型</th>\n<th>信息量</th>\n<th>接口</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SWO/ITM</td>\n<td>软件仪器化</td>\n<td>1 引脚</td>\n<td>printf 调试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ETM + TPIU</td>\n<td>完整指令流</td>\n<td>4-引脚 TracePort</td>\n<td>代码覆盖率分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MTB</td>\n<td>微型跟踪缓冲</td>\n<td>片内 SRAM</td>\n<td>M0+ 低成本跟踪</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"调试会话管理\">调试会话管理</h2><h3 id=\"连接与复位类型\">连接与复位类型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>复位类型</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>硬件复位</td>\n<td>NRST 引脚拉低</td>\n<td>完整系统复位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内核复位</td>\n<td>AIRCR.VECTRESET</td>\n<td>仅复位 CPU（外设保持）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系统复位</td>\n<td>AIRCR.SYSRESETREQ</td>\n<td>复位 CPU+外设</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接时不复位</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>附加到运行中的系统</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"半主机模式\">半主机模式</h3><p>半主机（Semihosting）机制允许目标代码通过调试器使用主机的 I/O 功能：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>目标</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>BKPT #0xAB</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>调试器拦截</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>执行 I/O</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>返回结果</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{目标} \\xrightarrow{\\text{BKPT \\#0xAB}} \\text{调试器拦截} \\xrightarrow{\\text{执行 I/O}} \\text{返回结果}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1191em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">目标</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1081em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">BKPT #0xAB</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.158em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">调试器拦截</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.147em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">执行</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"> I/O</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">返回结果</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>半主机适合开发阶段的调试输出，但会在断点处暂停 CPU 数毫秒，不适合实时系统和无调试器的生产环境。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调试器选型\">调试器选型</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调试器</th>\n<th>厂商</th>\n<th>接口</th>\n<th>SWO</th>\n<th>ETM</th>\n<th>价格范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ST-Link/V3</td>\n<td>ST</td>\n<td>SWD/JTAG</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>J-Link BASE</td>\n<td>SEGGER</td>\n<td>SWD/JTAG</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>J-Link PLUS</td>\n<td>SEGGER</td>\n<td>SWD/JTAG</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>J-Trace PRO</td>\n<td>SEGGER</td>\n<td>SWD/JTAG</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ULINK2</td>\n<td>Keil</td>\n<td>SWD/JTAG</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DAP-Link</td>\n<td>开源</td>\n<td>SWD</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>接口选型</strong>：JTAG 用 5 线、支持菊花链但占用引脚多；SWD 仅需 2 线、速率更高且推荐用于 Cortex-M。</li>\n<li><strong>CoreSight 架构</strong>：DP 负责物理协议层，经 AHB-AP 访问全部 4 GB 地址空间，经 APB-AP 访问 FPB/DWT/ITM/ETM 等调试组件。</li>\n<li><strong>断点</strong>：FPB 提供 6-8 个硬件断点无需改代码，数量不足时用 BKPT 软件断点，Flash 中代码需配合补丁重映射。</li>\n<li><strong>观测与计时</strong>：DWT 的数据观察点可捕捉变量被意外修改的瞬间，CYCCNT 提供单周期精度的计时。</li>\n<li><strong>跟踪</strong>：ITM/SWO 以极低时序开销实现 printf 风格输出，ETM+TPIU 可记录完整指令流用于覆盖率分析。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"JTAG/SWD 调试原理","id":"jtag-swd-调试原理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"调试接口概述","id":"调试接口概述"},{"level":2,"text":"CoreSight 调试架构","id":"coresight-调试架构"},{"level":3,"text":"组件层次","id":"组件层次"},{"level":3,"text":"DAP 访问流程","id":"dap-访问流程"},{"level":2,"text":"硬件断点","id":"硬件断点"},{"level":3,"text":"FPB 单元","id":"fpb-单元"},{"level":3,"text":"软件断点","id":"软件断点"},{"level":2,"text":"数据观察点","id":"数据观察点"},{"level":3,"text":"DWT 功能","id":"dwt-功能"},{"level":3,"text":"数据观察点配置","id":"数据观察点配置"},{"level":3,"text":"CYCCNT 周期计数器","id":"cyccnt-周期计数器"},{"level":2,"text":"ITM 跟踪输出","id":"itm-跟踪输出"},{"level":3,"text":"非侵入式 printf","id":"非侵入式-printf"},{"level":3,"text":"刺激端口","id":"刺激端口"},{"level":2,"text":"实时跟踪","id":"实时跟踪"},{"level":3,"text":"SWO 模式","id":"swo-模式"},{"level":3,"text":"ETM 指令跟踪","id":"etm-指令跟踪"},{"level":2,"text":"调试会话管理","id":"调试会话管理"},{"level":3,"text":"连接与复位类型","id":"连接与复位类型"},{"level":3,"text":"半主机模式","id":"半主机模式"},{"level":2,"text":"调试器选型","id":"调试器选型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"FreeRTOS 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/rtos-basics/freertos-practice"},"next":{"title":"性能分析与功耗优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/debugging-optimization/performance-power-optimization"}}